Error [jet.ArrowFunctionBody]: This named function body follows an arrow instead of braces.
  --> tests/ui/one_arrow_function_body.jet:1:31
    |
  1 | double: fn(value: Int) -> Int -> value * 2
    |                               ^^
 Why: A named function has one arrow, `->` or `-[Effects]>`, followed by its optional return type; the body always sits in braces: `name: fn(...) -> Type { … }`.
 Fix: Replace `-> expr` with `{ expr }`; `jet fmt` applies this fix.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0080

